      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{60ee9e81572cc51ad4e847e6|full_name} it seems that I would need CultureInfo.CurrentCulture.name, to match YouTube properly, but this is blacklisted currently (obtainable in editor via tostring but Ingame returns blank string)",
